{"id":"2260335569","kind":"answer","title":"当天背的内容到底回顾几次不浪费时间？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-12-07","updated":"2021-12-07","votes":33,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":1195,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","测试效应","长期记忆","记忆卡片"],"summary":"这个问题有两个方面： 如何回顾 回顾几次 如何回顾 首先，如何回顾？不知道题主是怎么回顾的。如果题主只是对着题目内容反复阅读，那么效果很差一点也不奇怪。 根据论文 Improving Students’ Learning With Effective Learning Techniques: Promising Directi…","question_detail_html":"<p>如题，大佬们我当天背的内容回顾四五次，晚上睡觉的时候反思感觉效率特别低，这样背的慢而且好像还是记不住，是不是我回顾次数太多的原因？求救，一整天就背了几道题</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/504279762/answer/2260335569","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"如何回顾"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"回顾几次"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"结束语"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"6kH6kjgR\">这个问题有两个方面：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"L0ejbqm4\">如何回顾</li><li data-pid=\"NYOQrCH-\">回顾几次</li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">如何回顾</h2><p data-pid=\"VcOTojlt\">首先，如何回顾？不知道题主是怎么回顾的。如果题主只是对着题目内容反复阅读，那么效果很差一点也不奇怪。</p><p data-pid=\"jqteIpEk\">根据论文 <i><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.1177/1529100612453266\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Improving Students’ Learning With Effective Learning Techniques: Promising Directions From Cognitive and Educational Psychology</a></i> 中的学习方法效果表格，我们可以看到，Rereading，也就是反复阅读，是非常低效的学习方法。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-40f788137274086fcfc9c9d0be1c2c22_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a154ad56fe64c94032b143b5796d4902\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a154ad56fe64c94032b143b5796d4902_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-40f788137274086fcfc9c9d0be1c2c22_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a154ad56fe64c94032b143b5796d4902\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a154ad56fe64c94032b143b5796d4902_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/><figcaption>为什么学习的同时不该记笔记！—— 三个致命的原因 https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/441291579</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"4mePg8ig\">那么，该如何回顾，才能更高效？我们需要利用测试效应：<b>如果你努力回忆某个细节，那么这个行为本身会强化对细节的记忆。</b><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9e64e871530057f6ee322786f874ac55_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ef3f611f8882ad097834575f8c4ada34\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ef3f611f8882ad097834575f8c4ada34_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1218\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9e64e871530057f6ee322786f874ac55_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ef3f611f8882ad097834575f8c4ada34\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ef3f611f8882ad097834575f8c4ada34_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1218\"/><figcaption>什么？考试有助于我的学习？：https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/57113246</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"5K-EFBxS\">建议题主在回顾过程中用背诵材料测试自己，这样才能有效的记住，而不浪费时间。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">回顾几次</h2><p data-pid=\"Xq1h6x62\">回顾到你可以一次完整地想起背诵内容即可。少了，那些缺失的内容还没记住，多了，反而会干扰你的其他记忆。</p><p data-pid=\"CFahS7wB\">关键点在于，你需要在日后多次复习，而非一日之内疯狂突击：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-12eb955b2d2fbf393ebef6f7fe249cdd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e332647c66eadea08591ac6a848234c5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e332647c66eadea08591ac6a848234c5_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-12eb955b2d2fbf393ebef6f7fe249cdd_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e332647c66eadea08591ac6a848234c5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e332647c66eadea08591ac6a848234c5_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Trq-RIKW\">1985 年，雷和莫迪利安尼对一群三年级的学生做了一个实验。在实验中，学生需要记忆乘法口诀和单词拼写。 </p><p data-pid=\"q26UQced\">为了对比集中重复和间隔重复之间的差异，学生被随机分为 <b>集中组</b> 和 <b>间隔组</b>： </p><ul><li data-pid=\"BnCT84W7\">在集中组中，学生需要在一天内重复记忆材料 4 次 </li><li data-pid=\"XAOQfRH6\">在间隔组中，学生在第 1 天、第 2 天、第 4 天、第 8 天分别重复 1 次材料（总计也是 4 次） </li></ul><p data-pid=\"NC_-ci2X\">当学生完成最后一次重复，就会参加最终测试。<b>实验结果是，集中组平均只记住了 53% 的材料，而间隔组则平均记住 70% 的材料。</b><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup></p><h2 id=\"sec-3\">结束语</h2><p data-pid=\"G6dHUR27\">关于如何提高长期记忆，已经有很多心理学研究，具体请参见：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2dbc2730b68fac71f549caab01eca920_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1170\" data-image-width=\"2076\" data-tm-id=\"420309917\" href=\"#/post/420309917\">叶峻峣：(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c411e5e812bd614048b34e5a1f48eb9f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1264\" data-image-width=\"2240\" data-tm-id=\"420924493\" href=\"#/post/420924493\">叶峻峣：(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应</a><p data-pid=\"aDoN4w86\">关于间隔重复的实践，可以参考：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fc5e91c7a88c26207775c8301afbe1f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"328\" data-image-width=\"1579\" data-tm-id=\"434074509\" href=\"#/post/434074509\">叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解</a><p data-pid=\"fdB_Rgrs\">希望上述内容对你有所帮助。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 测试效应 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"423449068\" href=\"#/post/423449068\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> Rea, Cornelius, and Vito Modigliani. “The Effect of Expanded versus Massed Practice on the Retention of Multiplication Facts and Spelling Lists.” Human Learning: Journal of Practical Research &amp; Applications 4 (January 1, 1970): 11–18. </li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420309917","title":"(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":170,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420924493","title":"(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":95,"minutes":32,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"423449068","title":"测试效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 3 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"420105707","title":"(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":310,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"453406457","title":"(5/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——脚注","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":38,"minutes":51,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"423065882","title":"(4/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——应用指南","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":117,"minutes":29,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"594372725","title":"用间隔重复软件记住一门编程语言","author":"Derek Sivers","votes":230,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Derek Sivers"},{"id":"402705173","title":"间隔重复记忆卡片应确保复习者必须从记忆中提取出答案","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2680582773","title":"怎样提高自己的记忆能力？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":815,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 815 赞同"},{"id":"2901234936","title":"ChatGPT 出现后，那些靠知识记忆取胜的教育模式会被颠覆吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":2309,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 2309 赞同"},{"id":"106940103882","title":"记忆是学习的基础，如何记住知识点？学习过的知识怎么记忆？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":103,"minutes":34,"reason":"相似问答 · 103 赞同"},{"id":"2790091530","title":"有什么值得分享的高效学习方法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":549,"minutes":129,"reason":"相似问答 · 549 赞同"},{"id":"2403765467","title":"没有主动回忆的间隔重复是可行的吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":40,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 40 赞同"}]}